  "conclusion": "The deployment stamps differ solely because deploy-overlays prepends different source_commit headers to otherwise byte-identical 63-row manifests. The workload and runtime content hashes are equal. This does not remove the strict different-stamp rejection or establish a valid A/B performance/adoption verdict.",
